; Flight is the one thing in the game with controls that exist nowhere else, so
; it carries its own card, sitting directly above the stance line and shown only
; while the feet are off the ground. The box reaches well above the plate and the
; panel shrinks to the bottom of it, so the card grows upwards as lines are added
; rather than pushing the stance line off the screen.
[node name="FlightPlate" type="HBoxContainer" parent="HUD/Prompts"]
